<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">Timothy khatna</book>
  <para style="h">Timothy khatna</para>
  <para style="toc1">Timothy khatna</para>
  <para style="toc2">Timothy khatna</para>
  <para style="mt">Timothy khatna</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesus Christ sawltak khat ahi Paul in, eite hong Ngumpa Pathian le eite lametna Jesus Christ thupiak na bangin —
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Upna sungah ka tapa tatak ahi Timothy tungah lai kong thaak hi: Pa Pathian le ih Topa Jesus Christ in, thuthiamna, hesuakna le thinnopna nang hong pia tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Macedonia ah ka pai lai, kong sawl sa bangma in Ephesus ah na taam tu kong deisak hi. Tua munah mihing pawlkhat in a maan ngawl upna thubulte hil hi, amate tuabang hilna pan a tawp natu in, thu na pia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kinialna bek a piangsak taanghthute le taanghpupite khang tepteena saute a vawk natu in na son in; tuate in upna taw a kihe Pathian ngealna taangtut natu in kizangh ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi thupiakna ii tupna sia, lungtang thiangtho, thinsung thiangtho le upna tatak panin hong piang ki itna a khanto thei natu deina hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mihing pawlkhat in hite panin lampial in a mawmawthuai kam kikupnate sungah ngammang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in Pathian thukham hil syate suak nuam ahihang, amate kammal tatak ma ahizong, kimuan tatakna taw a son uh thute ahizong a tel bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kizak tu bangin a kizangh nale Thukham sia pha hi ci in ih he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ih phawk tu a kul thu sia, thukhamte sia mihing phate atu a kivawt hi ngawlin, thukham paltante le khialna lian vawtte, pathian selte le a mawte, biakna kin ngawl le thaa mi ahi ngawlte, pate nute a thatlumte, mihing thatte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />numei le pa huvau a paktatte, numei le pa ngeina ngawlin a ngamtate, mihing a mante, leilotin thumaan ngawl tetti a pangte tua ahibuale a pha a kho upna thubul taw a kileebulin ngamtatna a neite atu in a kivawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuabang hilcianna sia ka thansak tu in hong ki aap lungdamna thu sungah kimu a, tua Lungdamna Thupha sia a minthang thupha toai Pathian kung pan hong pai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka nasep natu in thahatna hong pia Jesus Christ ih Topa tungah lungdam ka ko hi. Ama ii na seam tu in kilawm hong sakna le nasep hong piak hu in, ama tungah ka lungdam hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ahihang hun bosa sungah ama ngensia in, vawtsia in lang zazaan ngei hi kaleng, upna ka nei ma, heakna nei ngawlin ngamta ka hikom Pathian in kei hong hesuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciangin ih Topa in a thuthiamna a kicing takin hong buak a, Jesus Christ taw pumkhat hina sungah eite neisa ahi upna le ki itna kei tungah hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesus Christ in mawneite hun tu in leitung ah hong pai hi: ci sia thumaan hi a, a cing takin up tu le saan tu ahi hi. Tua a mawte sung pan keima in a mawbelpa ka hi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ahihang nungsang ciangin ama umin tawntung nuntakna a saang tute ii a ettee tu in, kei a mawbelpa tungah Jesus Christ in thinsauna a cingin hong lak thei natu, Pathian in kei hong hesuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama bek Pathian ahi a thi thei ngawl, a kimu thei ngawl Tawntung Kumpipa tungah patoaina le minthanna a tawntung a tawntungin om tahen! Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka ta Timothy awng, nangma huvau a hun bosa sungah kamsaan sonkholna a om bangin, hi thupiakna sia na khut sungah muangin kong aap hi. Ngal pha tak na sim thei natu in tua kammalte ngalhiam in zangh in a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />na upna kholet in, thinsung thiangtho na nei ta'n. Mihing pawlkhat a thinsung uh pan a phaw thute ngai ngawlin a upna uh lalsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Satan vaangletna nuai ah aapna taw daan ka piaksate sungah Hymenaeus le Alexander te kihel uh hi; Pathian min a daisak nawn ngawl natu in hi thu in amate hil tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaciang a masa phitbel kong hanthot nopna panin, maangkaana, thungetna, hu ngetna le lungdamkona sia mihing theampo atu Pathian tungah na vawt vun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />eite nuam takin kilem vadiam in om thei a, Pathian thasia in a kilawm ngamtatna taw ih nuntak thei natu in kumpite le a dang thu nei uliante atu zongh tuabangin na vawtsak natu kong thawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi bangin a pha ih vawtte in Pathian ih Ngumpa lungkimsak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />mihing khat sim ngupna nga a, thumaan thutak a heak tu sia Pathian in dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian khat bek om a, Pathian le mihing hong kilemsak kik, mihing ahi Jesus Christ khat bek om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in mihing nam theampo tat natu in, a nuntakna pia hi. Tua in a hun a cin ciang Pathian ii mihing khat sim ngupna a piak nopna thu a lakna hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tua thu hu in upna le thumaan thutak thangsak tu in, Gentile te ii sawltak khat le sya khat bangin hong kipuak hi. A leilot ka hi bua a; thumaan thutak son ka hi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawlpi sungah biakpiak simin, thin uukna le kinialna om ngawlin, a khut laamin thungen thei a, Pathian tungah a kipumpiak pasalte ii thu a nget tu ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Numeite zongh a kiniamkhiak ngamtatna le puansilh kizepna ah a etlawm, a hoi ciaciangin khua ngaisutna a nei tu ka dei hi; sam khawng a lamdadang in vawtna taw ahizong, khamhte, keptangte le a manham nikteen puansilhte taw ahizong kizeam ngawlin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />biakna kin numeite atu taw a kilawm ngamtat phate taw om tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Numeite in thim khipkhep in om thei in, kiniam khiakna theampo sin tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in pasalte tungah a hilcian tu ahizong, thu a nei natu ahizong, ka oai bua hi; amate thim khipkhep in om tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Adam kibitphua masa a, tua zawkciang Eve kibitphua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciangin theam a thuak sia in Adam hi ngawl hi; theam thuak a, Pathian thukham a paltan sia in numei ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang, ama in upna, ki itna le thianthona sungah omdan thiamna taw zom suak pole numei sia ta a neina tungtawnin kingum tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A maan kam teptee khat sia: Pasal khat in pawlpi lampui khat hi tu a uuk le, ama in nasep pha mama khat lungngul ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawlpi lampuipa khat in sit baanna nei ngawl ahi tu kisamh hi; ama in zi khat bek a nei, thinpha a nei, ama le ama a ki uk zo, a cilngil ahi kul hi; zindo thiam, ngual a hil thei ahi tu kisamh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama sia zukham thei le a ngoltol hi ngawl het tu a, cinghin ngual taw kilem thei tu hi; ama in sum bek ngaisun ngawl het tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ama in a bangkua sung pha takin uk thei tu a, a tate in zatakna takpi taw a thu a nitsak thei tu kisamh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile pasal khat in ama ii bangkua a uk natu zia a he buale Pathian ii pawlpi bangbangin keam thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in kiphatsakna taw a kidim Doaimangpa bangin pua vawkna a thuak ngawl natu in, upna sungah a khanthin sa khat hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in mindai in Doaimangpa thaang sungah a awk thak ngawl natu in, pawlpi puasia a om mihingte ii zatak khat hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawlpi upate zongh ngamtat pha nei tu a, a citakte ahi tu kisamh hi; amate in sapittui tam lei ne ngawl tu a, sum lam sangah duhop ngawl het tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />amate in upna thumaan a kipualaakte thinsung thiangtho taw kholet tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate kisinsak phot tu a, a kisinna a ong le seam tak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A zite uh zongh, ngamtat pha nei tu a, ngual ngen ngawl tu hi; amate in na theampo sungah thutuumin thumaan tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pawlpi upa khat in zi khat bek nei tu a, a tate le a bangkua sia pha takin uk zo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pawlpi upa nasep pha takin a seamte in amate atu dinmun pha khat nga hi a, Jesus Christ sungah a upna hangsan takin son ngam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hi lai kong at laitakin no kungah hong pai in hong mu pal tu, ci in lametna ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang kong hai tha le hi laithakin a nungta Pathian ii pawlpi, thumaan thutak ii dinna le a panpui ahi Pathian bangkua sungah ih ngamtat natu hong hesak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Eite biakna in a lian thuku khat a hina sia kuama in, a nial thei buatu hi: Ama sia mihing mealin hong kilangh a, Thumaan hi ci in Thaa in lakin, vantunglalangte in mu hi. Ama sia minamte sungah a thu kihil a, leitung theampo in ama umin, tuaciang vantung ah ama kila to hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thaa in thiangtho takin a sonna pan hun khaksang ciangin, mihing pawlkhat in a upna uh nusia tu hi; amate in, leilot thaa te thu ni tu a, doaite hilna zui tu hi ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuabang hilciannate sia leilot theite in theamna taw kizelsak hi, amate thinsung sia thiksa taw hal bangin thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuabang mihingte in zi nei ngawl pasal nei ngawlin omna le an pawlkhat neakna in khialna hi ci in hil hi. Ahihang thumaan thutak a hete le a umte in lungdamkona thungetna taw a neak tu in, tua ante sia Pathian piansak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian bitphua sa nate theampo pha hi; bangma nil tu vawk tu om ngawl hi, ahihang na theampo lungdamko thungetna taw saan tu ahi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />banghang ziam cile tuasia Pathian kammal le thungetna in Pathian ii saan thei suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangma in thaa thu ah upna kammalte taw kivaak a, thuhilna maan na zui kawmin, hi kong hilnate suapuite sungah na son nale nangma in Jesus Christ ii naseam pha khat na hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang a son thamman ngawl, Pathian ii thu taw a kisi ngawl phua tawm taanghthute pan na kikeam ta'n. Pathian dei bang na nuntak zawk natu in kisinna nei ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pumpi thasaalin kisinna in phatna pawlkhat nei hi, ahihang thaa thu ah kisinna in, tu hun le maisang hun atu nuntakna ahikom manpha zaw pek lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi thu in thumaan kam teptee khat hi a, up tu le a cing tak saan tu thumaan thutak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihing theampo le, a tuan in a umte a Ngumpa, a nungta Pathian sungah lametna ih nei hu in eite in nasia takin hanciam a, na ih seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi lamlaknate le hilnate amate tungah sonsawn in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khangmoi na hi hu in, kuama in na zawngsaksak heak in a, ahihang na pauna, na ngamtatna, na itna, upna le thiangthona sungah, thu umte ii ettee tu hi ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kong pai mateng in, na hun le na hanciamnate mihonpite tungah Laithiangtho simna, thuhilna le hilna in, na zangh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na sungah a om Thaa thiangtho telte na ngaingon heak in, tuate sia kamsaangte in pau a, pawlpi upate in na tungah khut hong ngak uh ciangin na nga uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hite, na kisisin ta'n a, nangma le nangma tuate atu in kipia ta'n, tua hile na khantona ngual theampo in hong mu tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangma le nangma ki en in a, na hilna zongh en in a, kidawm in. Hi bang na vawtte zom to ta'n; banghang ziam cile tuabangin na vawt le nangma le na thusonna hong za te in ngupna nga tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasal khanghaam zaw khat sia teih heak vun a, na pa bangin ngaisun in, na thuum zaw vun. Pasal khangmoizawte na suapui bangin vawt vun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />nupi a haamzawte sia na nute uh bang, numei a moizawte sia thinsung thiangtho tak taw na suapuinumeite uh bangin na vawt vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate nguak a, a om takpi meingongte thasia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahihang meingong khat in ta le tu a nei le, amate in biakna huvau sep tu a neite a innkuan sungah sin phot tahen, tua hile a nute a pate le a pute a pite ii ama tungah a sepnate a thuk kik hi tu hi, banghang ziam cile tua in Pathian diksak thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama nguak om a, kuama ama a en tu a nei ngawl meingong khat in, a lametna sia Pathian tungah koi a, sun taw zan taw ama ii hu natu in thungen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang meingong khat ama le ama cii le sa nopsakna sungah a kidia khat sia nungta napi a thisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate tungah kuama in maw a zon thei ngawl natu in, hi lamlaknate hil sawn in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang khat pawpo in a mealheakte, a tuanin ama innkuanpuite a en nuam bua uh le ama in upna thu a nial suak a, thu um ngawlte sangin sia zaw lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Meingong khat sia kum sawmluk a vaal bualai nale meingong tepteena lai sungah hel heak vun. Tua bek hi ngawlin tepteena lai sungah a tum thei tute sia khatvei bek pasal a neite,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuaciangin ngamtat pha nei hi ci in a kisonte: a tate pha takin a khangtosakte, a inn ah zin pha takin a dote, Tapidaw puite tungah a kiniamkhiakte, a ngim nga mi a hute, na pha seam tu in a kipumpiakte a hi tu kisam lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang a khangmoi zaw meingongte sia tua tepteena lai sungah hel heak vun, banghang ziam cile a pumpi deina zui in pasal a nei nop kik ciang, Christ kung panin lampial uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tuabangin ama tungah kamciam a piak maksak sia a paltanna taw a maw suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in inn khat pan inn khat ah vak kawkoai in hunte a luithawthongin bosak uh hi; a siazaw lai thu in, amate in ngual ngen a, mihing theampo nuammawin, a pau tuak ngawl thute pau uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahikom kei deina ah meingong khangmoite in pasal nei in ta nei a, a bangkua uh en tahen, tua hile ih ngalte in amate siatna a son tu hunpha a nga buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile meingong pawlkhat in Satan nungzui tu in heakkik zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihang Tapidaw numei khat in, a bangkua sungah meingong a om le, pawlpi tungah vanhngit suan ngawlin ama in en tahen, tua hile pawlpi in amate nguak a om meingong tatak teng en thei zaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lampuite bangin na pha tak a seam pawlpi upate, a tuanin thuhilna le laithiangtho hilna nasia tak a seamte, thaman a thuap nii in nga tuak hi ci in ngaisut tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile, laithiangtho in, “Taang a cil khuital muk tuamsak heak vun,” ci a, “Naseamte in a thaman a nga hamtang tu kilawm hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pawlpi upa khat a kimawsakna ah, nii ahibuale a tamzaw tetti a om buale, thu in sim heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngualdangte zongh a lau thei natu in a maw a khialte mihonpi mai ah teih in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na nasep napo kuama nguptuam paihtuam nei ngawlin kong thupiakte na nit natu in Pathian mai, Christ Jesus mai le a thiangtho vantunglalangte mai ah ciliap huai takin kong sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa naseam tu in aapna in mihing khat pawpo tungah na khut nga memeang heak in. Ngualdangte mawna vawtna sungah kihel heak in; nangma le nangma thiangtho takin kikeam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na cina thei tawntung ahikomin, na ngilsung an a zaan natu tui bek dawn ngawlin sapittui tawm ne in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mihing pawlkhatte mawna sia kilangh papai a, a mawna tungtaang ah thu khenna thuak masa pai hi; ahihang a dangte mawna ahile kinungmu pheang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuabang ma in ngamtat phatnate zongh kilangh pal a, a kilangh lei ngawlte ngawngawn zongh kiseal cip thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kuama in Pathian min le eite hilcianna a sonsiat ngawl natu in, sila ahi theampo in a tote zatakna piak tu kilawm hi, ci in a ngaisut kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tapidawte nei silate in a tote simmaw heak hen, banghang ziam cile, amate in unau khat ahi uh hi. Tua hi zaw ngawlin amate in a phazaw in na sepsak tahen, banghang ziam cile, phattuamna a ngate sia amate ii a it thu umte ahi hi. Hi thute hilin na hanthawn in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ih Topa Jesus Christ ii thumaan kammalte le ih biakna ii hilna taw a kisi ngawl upna thubul tumdang a hil sia in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />kiphatsakna taw a kidim hi a, bangma heak a nei bua hi. Ama in a pha ngawl kam kinialna le kihaunate kin a, tuasia in ki eenna, kikamtamna, kiselnona, thusia taw kimuanlaakna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />thumaan thutak nei nawn ngawl a, thinsung maan ngawlte ii kam kinialna te piangsak hi. Amate in biakna sia sumhau thei natu lampi khat in ngaisun uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mihing khat in a nei pawpo taw a lungkim nale biakna paaina in ama sia sumhau mama pa a suaksak takpi ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hi leitung ah bang ih keng ziam? Bangma ih keng bua hi! Leitung panin bang ih pusuapui thei tu ziam! Bangma ih pusuapui thei buatu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahiciang eite in anneak le puansilh ih nei le, eite atu in a kicing hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang sum a hau nuam mihingte sia ze etna thuakin, a mawmawthuai le siatna a piangsak thei deinate ii thaang sungah awk a siatna le lalna nga uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sum dei leilamna in siatna namcin ii a naak khat ahi hi. Pawlkhat in sum dei leilam ahikomin, upna pan pialin heena thinngimna tam mama thuak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian mihing ahi nangma in hite theampo na pial in. Thumaan thutanna, Pathian thu sungah nopsakna, upna, itna, thuak zawkna, ciknate na nei zawk natu hanciam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Upna tai kidemna sungah na hi thei tawpin tai in a, tuaciang nangma atu in tawntung nuntakna na sungsuam in; banghang ziam cile tetti tam mamate mai ah na upna kho takin na pualaak ciang hi nuntakna ah Pathian in nang hong sam ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na theampo nuntakna a pia Pathian mai le Pontius Pilate mai ah a upna kho takin, a pualaak Christ Jesus mai ah, nangma thu kong piakna pan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ih Topa Jesus Christ hong kilak kik Ni matengin, nang hong thupiaknate zui in thumaanna taw na keamcing in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpite ii Kumpi, topa te ii Topa, thupha sang Ukpa khat bek ahi Pathian in a hun a tun ciangin ama hong kilanghsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama bek thi maw a; kuama in a nai a neak thei ngawlna khuavak sungah teang hi. Kuama in ama mu ngeingawl a; kuama in ama mu thei ngeingawl tu hi. Ama ii tungah zatakna le tawntung ukzawkna om tahen! Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi nuntakna sungah a kizangh nate hauna taw a kiphatsak ngawl natu, tuabang a kho ngawl haunate tungah lametna koi ngawlin, ih nopsak natu a, na theampo ngo takin hong pia Pathian tungah lametna koi vun ci in a haute tungah na hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nasep pha te hau a, a pha ngamtatna nei in, a sep natu, ngo takin midangte na a hop nop natu hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu bangin maisang ah a kip doppha khat a suak tu sumngumte amate atu in a khol tu uh hi. Tua hile amate in nuntakna maan tatak a nei zo hong hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Timothy awng, nangma khut sungah muanna taw hong ki aapte pha takin keamcing in. Pawlkhatte ii “Heakna” ci in, a min a vaw khial, a kiihuai kampauna le mawmawt kam kinialnate na pial in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile mihing pawlkhatte in tua heakna ka nei uh hi, ci in kisuangtaak uh a, tua hu in a upna lampi bo sua uh hi. Pathian ii thuthiamna in note theampo tungah om tahen.
  </para>
</usx>
